      "title": "Recommended CIDR by scale",
      "items": [
        "Small (1-10 nodes): /24 · 256 IPs · dev and test",
        "Medium (10-100 nodes): /20 · 4,096 IPs · multi-AZ recommended",
        "Large (100+ nodes): /16 · 65,536 IPs · multi-AZ required"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Worked IP calculation",
      "items": [
        "m5.large: 3 ENIs × 10 IPs per ENI → up to 29 pods",
        "Required IPs = node count × max pods per node + system reservations",
        "Split subnets with small public ranges (/24) and larger private ranges (/20-/22)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Common mistakes",
      "items": [
        "Sizing the CIDR too small and running out of pod IPs",
